<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Columbia/HCA cut to hold.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Columbia/HCA cut to hold.</headline>
<dateline>LOUISVILLE, Ky. 1997-07-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hilliard Lyons healthcare analyst Stephen O'Neil said Friday he downgraded his rating on Columbia/HCA Healthcare Corp to hold from buy.</p>
<p>He said he made the move &quot;due to recent disclosures related to a widening federal investigation of the company at multiple levels.&quot;</p>
<p>Shares in the largest U.S. for-profit hospital company closed Thursday at 36-3/16.</p>
<p>((--Chicago Newsdesk 312-408-8787))</p>
